<aside class="mechanism-visual" aria-labelledby="custom-823-visual-title">
  <div class="mechanism-visual-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Verified mechanism visual</p>
    <h2 id="custom-823-visual-title">How the CUSTOM 823 Filling System Works</h2>
  </div>

  <dl class="mechanism-specs" aria-label="Verified CUSTOM 823 specifications">
    <div>
      <dt>Ink capacity</dt>
      <dd>1.5 mL</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Nib</dt>
      <dd>14K, No.15</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Filling system</dt>
      <dd>Plunger-type ink filling mechanism</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <ol class="mechanism-steps" aria-label="Verified CUSTOM 823 filling sequence">
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <p>Loosen the end cap.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <p>Pull the end cap all the way out.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <p>Insert the nib into the ink bottle.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <p>Hold the pen upright and push the knob straight back in.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">5</span>
      <p>A vacuum is created, and ink is drawn into the pen as the knob returns.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span aria-hidden="true">6</span>
      <p>Secure the end cap clockwise, remove the pen from the ink, and wipe away excess ink.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="mechanism-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="pen-line">
      <span class="nib-shape"></span>
      <span class="barrel-shape"></span>
      <span class="plunger-shape"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram-flow">
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
      <span></span>
    </div>
  </div>

